        "description": "<p>You know all three Technomancer signature abilities: Compile Sprite, Resonance Strike, and Resonance Mending. None of them costs Resonance; spending Resonance boosts them. You also gain <strong>Special Sprite</strong>, which rolls first — the tier buys 1, 2 or 3 Actions, and only then do you say what the sprite is for. It costs 3 Resonance in combat and nothing out of combat.</p>",
